 house in English.\n A family area with many play environments and a new play landscape.\n A shop offering a unique range for a sustainable country life.\n Seasonal scents and local flavors in the shop, café, and inn.\n Swedish star chef Tommy Myllymäki&#8217;s restaurant.\n Overnight stays in cosy manor setting at Julita Inn.\n Opening hours 2024\n Sat-Sun from May 25\n Daily June 15–August 25\n Sat-Sun September 1–29\n Autumn and winter: the park is open to explore on your own\n Visit Julita Manor\n Go to Julita Manor&#8217;s site \n Explore our cultural historical destination outside Katrineholm in western Sörmland.\n Together we explore Nordic Life\n Newsletter\n Our newsletter is mainly in Swedish, but you&#039;re welcome to sign up!\n E-mail \n Visit the Museum\n Visit the Museum \n Visit us \n Getting here \n Exhibitions \n Visit options \n Group visit \n About the website\n About the website \n Accessibility \n Cookies \n About the museum\n About the museum \n About us \n Contact us \n Press \n EXPLORE DJURGÅRDEN\n EXPLORE DJURGÅRDEN \n Royal Djurgården \n Destinations\n Destinations \n Julita Manor\n Tyresö Palace\n Svindersvik\n Härkeberga\n &copy; Nordiska museet 2026\n Founded 1873","frames":["https://www.googletagmanager.com/ns.html?id=GTM-NMJDKS"],"links":[["https://biljetter.nordiskamuseet.se/?lang=EN","Tickets"],["https://www.nordiskamuseet.se/en/visit-us/opening-hours/","Open today 10–17"],["https://www.nordiskamuseet.se/en/",""],["https://www.nordiskamuseet.se/","Svenska"],["https://www.nordiskamuseet.se/en/","English"],["https://www.nordiskamuseet.se/en/visit-us/opening-hours/","Open today 10–17"],["https://www.nordiskamuseet.se/en/visit-us/","Visit us"],["https://www.nordiskamuseet.se/en/visit-us/opening-hours/","Opening hours"],["https://www.nordiskamuseet.se/en/visit-us/admission/","Admission"],["https://www.nordiskamuseet.se/en/visit-us/getting-here/","Getting here"],["https://www.nordiskamuseet.se/en/visit-us/visit-options/","Visit options"],