igns. These cookies track visitors across websites and collect information to provide customized ads.\n Kaka Varaktighet Beskrivning __Host-GAPS 2 years This cookie allows the website to identify a user and provide enhanced functionality and personalisation. test_cookie 15 minutes doubleclick.net sets this cookie to determine if the user's browser supports cookies. VISITOR_INFO1_LIVE 6 months YouTube sets this cookie to measure bandwidth, determining whether the user gets the new or old player interface. VISITOR_PRIVACY_METADATA 6 months YouTube sets this cookie to store the user's cookie consent state for the current domain. YSC session Youtube sets this cookie to track the views of embedded videos on Youtube pages. yt.innertube::nextId never YouTube sets this cookie to register a unique ID to store data on what videos from YouTube the user has seen. yt.innertube::requests never YouTube sets this cookie to register a unique ID to store data on what videos from YouTube the user has seen. \n AVVISA ALLA \n SPARA INSTÄLLNINGAR","frames":[],"links":[["https://www.raa.se/",""],["https://www.raa.se/in-english/","In English"],["https://www.raa.se/",""],["https://app.raa.se/open/arkivsok/search","Arkivsök"],["https://app.raa.se/open/bebyggelse/","Bebyggelseregistret"],["https://raa.primo.exlibrisgroup.com/discovery/search?vid=46VITT_INST:Vitterhetsakademiens_bibliotek","Bibliotekssök Vitalis"],["https://app.raa.se/open/fornsok/","Fornsök"],["https://www.kringla.nu/kringla/","Kringla"],["https://www.raa.se/hitta-information/runor/","Runor"],["https://www.raa.se/hitta-information/","Fler söktjänster"],["https://www.raa.se/",""],["https://www.raa.se/",""],["https://www.raa.se/",""],["https://www.raa.se/aktuellt/","Aktuellt"],["https://www.raa.se/aktuellt/aktuella-fragor/","Aktuella frågor och uppdrag"],["https://www.raa.se/aktuellt/nyhetsbrev/","Nyhetsbrev"],["https://www.raa.se/aktuellt/press/","Press och media"],["https://www.raa.se/aktuellt/jobba-hos-oss/","Jobba hos oss"]