ttps://nasslott.com/":{"status":0,"error":"ENOTFOUND"},"https://mems.com/":{"status":200,"final":"https://www.mems.com/","title":"Generator Hire UK | Emergency &amp; Planned Power Solutions","text":"Generator Hire UK | Emergency & Planned Power Solutions \n 08452 230 400 \n Contact \n Careers \n Menu \n Home \n Why MEMS? \n Sustainability \n ESG \n Emergency Generator Hire \n Disaster Recovery Plan \n Generator Rental \n Products \n Cleaner Options \n Battery Energy Storage Systems \n Generators \n HVO Generators \n Stage V Generators \n HVO – Greener fuel \n Generator Accessories \n HV Solutions \n Services \n Logistics \n Generator Installation \n Tracking &#038; Telemetry \n Fuel Management \n 24 Hour Control Room \n Sectors \n Utilities \n Healthcare \n Data Centres \n Facilities Management \n Film, TV &#038; Live Events \n Sport Stadiums &#038; Arenas \n Education \n Contact \n Quote Form \n Careers \n News \n Case Studies \n Updates \n GENERATOR HIRE: EMERGENCY OR PLANNED\n Power restored fast. MEMS delivers 24/7, 365-day generator hire, planned or emergency, across the UK.\n Contact us\n 08452 230 400 \n Contact Us \n -->\n EMERGENCY\nHIRE\n MEMS offers rapid, reliable generator hire services near you, available 24/7, 365 days a year, ensuring your power needs are met anywhere in the UK. \n With our large fleet of temporary generators for hire , MEMS will keep your business or construction sites up and running during any power cut; that is why we can proudly say that no matter what the emergency, nothing is impossible for us here at MEMS Power Generation.\n VIEW EMERGENCY GENERATOR HIRE \n PLANNED\nHIRE\n If you need support for a planned power outage, then you can rely on MEMS for everything you need.  From diesel generators and accessories to high-voltage power generation and fuel tanks, we are the specialists to help ensure things run smoothly.\n We set the standard with one of the most extensive hire fleets in the UK, controlled and managed by our team of highly skilled engineers.\n VIEW PLANNED POWER SUPPORT \n CRITICAL POWER. FULLY MANAGED.\n Across the UK, MEMS keeps critical operations running through temporary power, logistics, fuel management, live monitoring and emergency response.\n sustainability & responsibility\n At MEMS, we're committed to creating a more sustainable future. We recognise that small changes can make a significant impact, which is why we're constantly searching for smarter, greener solutions to reduce our carbon footprint and protect our planet. Our dedication to sustainability extends to every aspect of our business, from our temporary generators to how we operate our facilities.\r\n We acknowledge that our actions impact the environment and future generations. That's why we're dedicated to making positive changes today. By making conscious choices and taking action to promote sustainable practices, we can work together to build a better, more sustainable future for all.\n The most effective way to achieve a Net Zero future is by significantly reducing emissions, which requires a complete shift in mindset. To attain the ultimate goal of Net Zero, businesses must undergo substantial organisational changes. Companies that can align their corporate objectives and plans with the transition to Net Zero will be able to make the shift to a low-carbon economy more efficiently, increasing their resilience and efficiency.\n VIEW PLANNED POWER SUPPORT \n case studies\n Explore some of our case studies… \n CASE STUDIES \n Football Stadium Power Solution: Rapid Emergency Response \nPower Crisis at a Premier League Stadium One of Europe’s largest clubs, competing in the Premier League faced a serious power... \n Read More \n emissions &#038; fuel reduced by 43% \nEfficient Emergency Power: Fuel and Emissions Saved. Just two miles from Gatwick Airport, a long-established freight packaging specialist faced a... \n Read More \n Keeping power reliable for leading data centre \nData Centre Temporary Power This case study shows how MEMS Power Generation supported a London data centre during a prolonged... \n Read More \n Emergency Power: MEMS Rapid Response for University Outage \nUniversity Emergency Power Solution in Action When one of the UK’s largest universities suffered a major power outage, MEMS Power... \n Read More \n Black Start Solutions for Reliable Power Restoration \nEnsuring Power Station Resilience with Black Start Solutions A UK power station recently required a complete temporary power solution for... \n Read More \n Powering History: MEMS Keeps the Tower of London Running \nEnsuring uninterrupted operations and business continuity for over 12 weeks Critical temporary power was urgently required at the Tower of... \n Read More \n MORE FROM MEMS\n EMERGENCY POWER\n Emergency generator hire \n24 hours a day\n365 days a year.\n PLANNED OUTAGE\n Generator hire specialists\nfor everything you need.\n SUSTAINABILITY \n Learn more about MEMS's\ncommitment to sustainability\n GENERATORS\n 30kVA - 2000kVA generators, plus\nmulti-set paralleling up\nto 25MW standby power.\n OUR SERVICES\n Providing a total turn-key\nsolution for all your power outage\nrequirements.\n WHY MEMS\n MEMS sets the standard\nin generator hire with one\nof the most extensive\nfleets in the UK.\n TALK TO US\n We'll help you find the best temporary power solution.\n 08452 230 400 \n Contact Us \n Home \n Why MEMS? \n Sustainability \n ESG \n Emergency Generator Hire \n Disaster Recovery Plan \n Generator Rental \n Products \n Cleaner Options \n Battery Energy Storage Systems \n Generators \n HVO Generators \n Stage V Generators \n HVO – Greener fuel \n Generator Accessories \n HV Solutions \n Services \n Logistics \n Generator Installation \n Tracking &#038; Telemetry \n Fuel Management \n 24 Hour Control Room \n Sectors \n Utilities \n Healthcare \n Data Centres \n Facilities Management \n Film, TV &#038; Live Events \n Sport Stadiums &#038; Arenas \n Education \n Contact \n Quote Form 