https://rabelovslott.com/":{"status":0,"error":"ENOTFOUND"},"https://rabelovsslott.com/":{"status":0,"error":"ENOTFOUND"},"https://rinkesta.com/":{"status":0,"error":"ENOTFOUND"},"https://rinkestaslott.com/":{"status":0,"error":"ENOTFOUND"},"https://ronneholm.com/":{"status":0,"error":"ENOTFOUND"},"https://rinkestasslott.com/":{"status":0,"error":"ENOTFOUND"},"https://ronneholms.com/":{"status":0,"error":"ENOTFOUND"},"https://ronneholmslott.com/":{"status":0,"error":"ENOTFOUND"},"https://ronneholmsslott.com/":{"status":0,"error":"ENOTFOUND"},"https://rossjoholm.com/":{"status":0,"error":"ENOTFOUND"},"https://ljung.com/":{"status":0,"error":"UND_ERR_CONNECT_TIMEOUT"},"https://rossjoholms.com/":{"status":0,"error":"ENOTFOUND"},"https://rossjoholmslott.com/":{"status":0,"error":"ENOTFOUND"},"https://rossjoholmsslott.com/":{"status":0,"error":"ENOTFOUND"},"https://rottnero.com/":{"status":0,"error":"ENOTFOUND"},"https://rottnerosherrgard.com/":{"status":0,"error":"ENOTFOUND"},"https://rottneroslott.com/":{"status":0,"error":"ENOTFOUND"},"https://rottnerosslott.com/":{"status":0,"error":"ENOTFOUND"},"https://runsa.com/":{"status":200,"final":"https://runsa.com/","title":"","text":"","frames":[],"links":[]},"https://runsaslott.com/":{"status":0,"error":"ENOTFOUND"},"https://runsasslott.com/":{"status":0,"error":"ENOTFOUND"},"https://salnecke.com/":{"status":0,"error":"ENOTFOUND"},"https://salneckeslott.com/":{"status":0,"error":"ENOTFOUND"},"https://rottneros.com/":{"status":200,"final":"https://www.rottneros.com/","title":"Specialists in pulp and molded fiber | Rottneros","text":"Specialists in pulp and molded fiber | Rottneros \r\n Skip to main content Skip to navigation Skip to search \n Products Robur Flash UKP by Rottneros \n Robur Flash ECF by Rottneros \n Spring by Rottneros \n Nature by Rottneros \n Data sheets \n Services Forest services \n Customer service \n Application areas Cartonboard \n Filters \n Electrotechnical applications \n Fiber cement \n Special applications \n Tissue paper \n Molded fiber \n About us Briefly about Rottneros Our history \n Our values \n Our business \n Rottneros Packaging Nature by Rottneros \n New Product Development \n About Rottneros Packaging \n Contact & Events \n Vallvik Mill \n Rottneros Mill \n Nykvist Skogs \n Strategy Business model \n Priorities \n Targets and results \n Trends \n Market \n Positioning \n Innovation \n Governance Board of directors Board's work \n Management Group management's work \n Remuneration \n Nomination Committee \n General meetings \n Articles of association \n Auditors \n Corporate governance reports \n Sustainability Sustainability targets \n Focus areas \n Materiality analysis \n Sustainability reporting \n Policies Code of Conduct \n Anti-Corruption policy \n Certificates and awards \n Whisteblowing service \n Investors Rottneros as an investment \n Financial targets \n Financial data \n The share The share data \n Shareholders \n Dividend policy \n Reports and presentations \n Calendar \n Rights issue \n Careers Working at Rottneros \n Career development \n Job opportunities \n Meet our employees \n Press room Press releases and news \n Subscribe \n Mediabank \n Order printed information \n Contact \n Search \n SE EN \r\n See the video about Rottneros \r\n Specialists in pulp and molded fiber\n Rottneros always uses raw material from sustainable forests. \n Our employees technical skills, access to both chemical and mechanical pulp and the high quality of our products make us a first-class supplier of market pulp. Renewable products and sustainable solutions are our passion. \n World-leading supplier of pulp to our selected niches\n The Rottneros Group is a world-leading manufacturer of E-grade pulp, which is used as insulation material for electrotechnical applications. We are also a world-leading supplier of pulp for the production of air and liquid filters. The availability of both chemical and mechanical pulp allows us to combine qualities to the desired properties of the pulp.\n Our products \n Molded fiber packaging that can be recycled or composted\n The environment and health guide more and more people&rsquo;s choice of products. Rottneros packaging solutions, Nature by Rottneros, have been developed by our experts over many years. Today, many companies want to strengthen their sustainability profile and have discovered the advantages of using Rottneros molded fiber for packaging. Nature by Rottneros is so natural that it can be composted or recycled.\n Nature by Rottneros \n Press releases\n 6 Aug 2026 - Regulatory\n Rottneros’ interim report January–June 2026\n 4 Aug 2026 - Non regulatory\n Invitation to Rottneros’ interim report for Q2 2026\n 27 May 2026 - Regulatory\n Bulletin from AGM in Rottneros\n All releases \n Calendar\n 2026-10-22\n Interim report January - September 2026\n Add to calendar \n Financial calendar \n Latest report\n 06 Aug 2026\n Interim report January-June 2026\n Press release \n Report \n Presentation \n Webcast \n All reports and presentations \n The share\n RROS\n SEK \n ( %)\nRottneros shares have been listed on Nasdaq Stockholm since 1987 and are classified as a company share in the Basic Resources Mid Cap segment.\n Our share \n Corporate governance\n The overall objective of corporate governance is to meet, as far as possible, shareholders’ demands for good returns on invested capital. Rottneros adheres to Swedish corporate governance codes.\n Board of Directors \n Management \n General meetings \n Corporate governance \n Upcoming AGM\n Rottneros' AGM 2026 took place on 27 May 2026.\n AGM archive \n Sustainability\n Rottneros runs a long-term sustainable and profitable business, contributes to a cleaner world with its products, and creates stimulating work opportunities \nin smaller locations.\n Sustainability \n FAQ\n Here to the right, you will find the answer to some of the most common questions we receive.\n Can't find the answer you're looking for? \nContact us with your question, and we'll get back to you.\n Contact \n What is Rottneros' main business?\n Rottneros is an independent producer of high quality market pulp for selected niches. A growth area within the Group is molded fiber and sustainable packaging solutions, primarily for the food industry. We constantly develop our offer in line with the market's needs, always with care for the environment.\n What companies are part of the Rottneros Group?\n The Group comprises Rottneros AB, listed on Nasdaq Stockholm, and its subsidiaries: Rottneros Mill AB and Vallvik Mill AB, focused on market pulp production and sales. The Group also includes Rottneros Packaging AB, specializing in molded fiber, the forestry operator Nykvist Skogs AB and raw material procurement company SIA Rottneros Baltic in Latvia. Read more, our business: \n What are your key markets?\n Rottneros focuses on delivering to the selected niche markets; Pulp for air and liquid filters, cardboard and packaging manufacturing and E-pulp for electrotechnical insulation materials. Application areas. \nAbout 66 percent of Rottneros' total sales, based on turnover, go to Europe, about 26 percent to Asia and about 8 percent to North America (year 2023). Read more about Rottneros' marketing organisation. \n How does Rottneros approach sustainability?\n Sustainability is central to Rottneros' operations. Ensuring a safe, secure work environment is the top priority. The Group aims for fossil-free production and works to minimize environmental impact through recycling and self-produced electricity.\n How does Rottneros ensure product quality?\n Rottneros ensures quality through strict quality control processes in its laboratories and regular inspections according to its certification standards. The company continuously optimizes and develops its products and processes.\n Careers\n Job opportunities\n Working at Rottneros\n Meet our employees\n Quick links\n Contact \n Media \n Subscribe \n Address\n Rottneros AB (publ)\nBox 144\n826 23 S&ouml;derhamn\n 0270-622 00 \n [email&#160;protected] \n Visiting address\n Rottneros AB\nVallviks Bruk\n826 79 Vallvik\n © 2026 Copyright Rottneros.\n Cookie policy \n Privacy policy \n This website uses cookies to provide the best possible user experience. By accepting you consent to cookies being used. If you want to find out more or disable cookies, please click here .\n Cookie settings Accept all \n Cookie settings \n Necessary cookies \n These cookies are essential for the site to work and provide you with a better user experience.\n Functional cookies \n We use Vimeo and YouTube to show videos on our website and the video player places cookies on your computer. \n Cookies for analysis and marketing purposes \n Analytics cookies help us understand how you use our website to improve your experience. They collect anonymous information about your website visit.\n Marketing cookies are used to show more relevant ads and promotions based on your visit and interests on our website.\n Read more in our Cookie Policy .\n Save and close","frames":["https://customer-45luhql9ezbrg4cv.cloudflarestream.com/b99dfdb42937418f918df16a4d4e79ef/iframe?autoplay=true&muted=true&controls=false&loop=true"],"links":[["https://www.rottneros.com/",""],["https://www.rottneros.com/",""],["https://www.rottneros.com/products/","Products"],["https://www.rottneros.com/products/robur-flash-ukp/","Robur Flash UKP by Rottneros"],["https://www.rottneros.com/products/robur-flash-ecf/","Robur Flash ECF by Rottneros"],["https://www.rottneros.com/products/spring-by-rottneros/","Spring by Rottneros"],["https://www.rottneros.com/about-us/rottneros-packaging/","Nature by Rottneros"],["https://www.rottneros.com/products/datasheet/","Data sheets"],["https://www.rottneros.com/services/","Services"],["https://www.rottneros.com/services/forest-services/","Forest services"],["https://www.rottneros.com/services/customer-service/","Customer service"],["https://www.rottneros.com/application-areas/