18.287976fc18d82799c823b291/1725477921893/x480p/Ehrenstrahlsalongen-360.webp 480w, /images/18.287976fc18d82799c823b291/1725477921893/x640p/Ehrenstrahlsalongen-360.webp 640w, /images/18.287976fc18d82799c823b291/1725477921893/x800p/Ehrenstrahlsalongen-360.webp 800w, /images/18.287976fc18d82799c823b291/1725477921893/x960p/Ehrenstrahlsalongen-360.webp 960w, /images/18.287976fc18d82799c823b291/1725477921893/x1120p/Ehrenstrahlsalongen-360.webp 1120w, /images/18.287976fc18d82799c823b291/1725477921893/x1280p/Ehrenstrahlsalongen-360.webp 1280w, /images/18.287976fc18d82799c823b291/1725477921893/x1440p/Ehrenstrahlsalongen-360.webp 1440w, /images/18.287976fc18d82799c823b291/1725477921893/Ehrenstrahlsalongen-360.webp 1500w\" sizes=\"100vw\" src=\"/images/18.287976fc18d82799c823b291/1725477921893/Ehrenstrahlsalongen-360.webp\"></a></div>\n<div class=\"sv-row sv-layout\" id=\"svid10_716aa34e16ed5a9f480316e\"><div class=\"sv-layout sv-skip-spacer sv-column-4\" id=\"svid10_716aa34e16ed5a9f480316f\"><div class=\"sv-text-portlet sv-use-margins sv-skip-spacer\" id=\"svid12_716aa34e16ed5a9f4803170\"><div id=\"Rubrik\"><!-- Rubrik --></div><div class=\"sv-text-portlet-content\"><h1 class=\"heading\" id=\"h-EhrenstrahlDrawingRoomin360\">Ehrenstrahl Drawing Room in 360°</h1></div></div>\n<div class=\"sv-text-portlet sv-use-margins\" id=\"svid12_716aa34e16ed5a9f4803171\"><div id=\"Ingress\"><!-- Ingress --></div><div class=\"sv-text-portlet-content\"><p class=\"preamble\">The Ehrenstrahl Drawing Room is named after its many paintings by court painter David Klöcker Ehrenstrahl. Click on the image above to start the tour and experience the art in the grand state room.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"sv-text-portlet sv-use-margins\" id=\"svid12_716aa34e16ed5a9f4803172\"><div id=\"Innehall\"><!-- Innehåll --></div><div class=\"sv-text-portlet-content\"><p class=\"normal\">Ehrenstrahl&#39;s paintings depict important events in the life of Queen Hedvig Eleonora and her son Karl XI in the form of allegories. In the virtual tour the allegories are explained.</p><p class=\"normal\">The tour also shows French rococo chairs, Chinese porcelain and a rococo clock.</p><p class=\"normal\">The Ehrenstrahl Drawing Room can be visited during Drottningholm Palace&#39;s regular opening hours, but also with this 360° tour. <em>Click on the image above to start the tour.</em></p></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sv-layout sv-column-4\" id=\"svid10_716aa34e16ed5a9f4803173\"><div class=\"sv-image-portlet sv-portlet sv-skip-spacer\" id=\"svid12_716aa34e16ed5a9f4803174\"><div id=\"Bild1\"><!-- Bild 1 --></div><a href=\"https://vr.kungligaslotten.se/ehrenstrahlsalongen_english\" rel=\"external\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"sv-noborder c18013\"  width=\"410\" height=\"273\" srcset=\"/images/18.716aa34e16ed5a9f4803136/1576063735906/x160p/ehrenstrahlsalongen-drottningholm-virtuell-visning-360.jpg 160w, /images/18.716aa34e16ed5a9f4803136/1576063735906/x320p/ehrenstrahlsalongen-drottningholm-virtuell-visning-360.jpg 320w, /images/18.716aa34e16ed5a9f4803136/1576063735906/ehrenstrahlsalongen-drottningholm-virtuell-visning-360.jpg 410w\" sizes=\"100vw\" src=\"/images/18.716aa34e16ed5a9f4803136/1576063735906/ehrenstrahlsalongen-drottningholm-virtuell-visning-360.jpg\"></a><p class=\"env-text-caption-01\"><span class=\"sv-image-caption\">Look up! Discover the paintings by Ehrenstrahl in the virtual tour by clicking on the image.</span> </p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"sv-layout sv-template-portlet\n\" id=\"svid30_58fbba5d1623a378c483b35\"><div id=\"Extradela\"><!-- Extra dela --></div><div class=\"sv-script-portlet sv-portlet sv-skip-spacer sv-template-portlet\n\" id=\"svid12_42f96a77162194c1bf4d6a_svid30_58fbba5d1623a378c483b35\"><div id=\"SkriptDela-1\"><!-- Skript Dela --></div><a href=\"\" class=\"lp-extra-share-link\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"lp-icon\">\n  <use xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" xlink:href=\"/webdav/files/system/svg/lp-icons.svg#lp-