ottet/infor-besoket/app-med-vagledning.html\">\n            \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg class=\"lp-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><use xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" xlink:href=\"/webdav/files/system/svg/lp-icons.svg#lp-crown\"></use></svg>\n\t\t\t\t<span>App med vägledning</span></a>\n            <span class=\"lp-flowitem-meta\"><span class=\"lp-openhours__text lp-openhours__text--open\">Öppet idag  10.00-16.00</span></span>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"lp-flowitem-info-content\">\n               <p>Upptäck appen 'Kungliga slotten' som guidar dig genom den kungliga historien, och även ...</p>\n         </div>\n      </div>\n</div>\n      <div class=\"lp-clickable-area lp-flowitem lp-flowitem-wrapper--besoksmalundersida \" >\n\n\t\t         <div class=\"lp-cover\"><div class=\"lp-cover__image c18414\" ></div></div>\n\t\t\n      <div class=\"lp-flowitem-info \">\n         <div class=\"lp-flowitem-info-header \">\n                          <a class=\"lp-flowitem-link\" href=\"/vara-besoksmal/kungliga-slottet/infor-besoket/kungliga-slottet-for-barn.html\">\n            \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg class=\"lp-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><use xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" xlink:href=\"/webdav/files/system/svg/lp-icons.svg#lp-crown\"></use></svg>\n\t\t\t\t<span>Kungliga slottet för Barn</span></a>\n            <span class=\"lp-flowitem-meta\"><span class=\"lp-openhours__text lp-openhours__text--open\">Öppet idag  10.00-16.00</span></span>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"lp-flowitem-info-content\">\n               <p>Slottets stora paradvåningar, de medeltida valven i Museum Tre Kronor och kungakronorna...</p>\n         </div>\n      </div>\n</div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sv-fixed-fluid-grid sv-grid-1290 sv-layout sv-template-layout\" id=\"svid10_4215df4d191da8db619b33c3_svid30_1124f9d51611ae23d8852d0\